@Analytics.Service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290
@token = paste-a-valid-identity-service-jwt-here

### Swagger UI
GET {{Analytics.Service_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html

### Summary: all available history
GET {{Analytics.Service_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Summary for October 2026
GET {{Analytics.Service_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/summary?startDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-10-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Top requested resources
GET {{Analytics.Service_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/top-resources?startDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-10-31T23:59:59Z&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Denial reasons
GET {{Analytics.Service_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/denial-reasons?startDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-10-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid range -> expect 400
GET {{Analytics.Service_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/summary?startDate=2026-10-31T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
